{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_038_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ca59f2e20de7f89f7c78eafba4a7d5f41b4c3a553b84afa41088b4774a81f130",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_038_22:5_01_038_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d109e941abbc758f1596fd0171c95a6574d042f2ae6077c29d9bd7edb35af1b",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，那盒巧克力是怎么回事？\n……啊，说起来今天确实是情人节啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_038_22:5_01_038_22_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b26a30926e8c4a825883af5ba6671f2cb679a5c80dd0a3de0a8983435d22de4e",
      "text": "诶，是给我的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_038_22:5_01_038_22_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:528f27b89b9cc6c766abcfebe6b0c5ade8d026a5ce3c634df0057a56e7777216",
      "text": "这种时候，虽然不太清楚\n该说些什么才好……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_038_22:5_01_038_22_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a556e813fba1c95f85f291b64c6a30438a43ecf5314f9d8cb2dc9a3c932210b3",
      "text": "谢了，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_038_22:5_01_038_22_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:deefa2780307e4fcf5067784b3c59cf167b940dbc778c2736bf5b3bd6124b4a0",
      "text": "我会怀着珍惜的心情享用的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_038_22:5_01_038_22_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f7c839cba6710e56b6d833dea65b39cb1200003e3ba443c46a7b3290708f04b",
      "text": "这盒巧克力，是给我的吗？\n这样啊，今天确实是情人节来着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_038_22:5_01_038_22_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a556e813fba1c95f85f291b64c6a30438a43ecf5314f9d8cb2dc9a3c932210b3",
      "text": "谢了，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_038_22:5_01_038_22_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ce323f552b28329f4f25c228450b2500eaefb161585f2cbb9c014a90707f1dc",
      "text": "看起来很好吃的巧克力啊。\n那个……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_038_22:5_01_038_22_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c700e60e27bb2121e4a75dc4b2c51a6289c4f9f4273cd55725713945b69331fb",
      "text": "我超高兴的。\n正因为是你送的，大概我才会格外这么觉得吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_038_22:5_01_038_22_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d4ec2da50960d1a166cb829d756e7a449eb04c733d470c6c79a51e72457dfe5",
      "text": "啊，对了。既然收到了巧克力，\n我也得回点什么才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_038_22:5_01_038_22_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e157b1494edf767b7666d971c10acb768e1efae6e01a71a0446d60285ceeb642",
      "text": "虽然一下子想不出来……\n不过我会好好考虑能让你高兴的东西的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_038_22:5_01_038_22_b:cmd-000055:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93cb6d9ad048b3aa701b82ed23247ce8e93786153d4c9b1963ef93e7d321bd8f",
      "text": "非常感谢！我很期待哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_038_22:5_01_038_22_b:cmd-000056:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e677dbefbecdede85f9cb1cc5e5b312230598542b0f5ae68bdf97d7029a494a9",
      "text": "只要是武先生送的，什么我都会很高兴的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_038_22:5_01_038_22_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7445b0ea0561dd6b28d1e70583e7d646bdbde93a2fbf187d9741b991250edce",
      "text": "嗯。等我吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_038_22:5_01_038_22_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86039619e787eda75eb7135cbae8af3d1c48b55f516a78bf5c49f368804c7282",
      "text": "被你这么期待虽然有点难办……\n但我会努力试试看的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
